WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.690
The transcript, with the point on the first heading

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:01.730
- folds everything

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.110
2 and 3 open one level at a time

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:03.800
n moves from heading to heading

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.870
TAB folds and unfolds one node

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:06.900
+ unfolds everything
